Interview ke liye hierarchy ke important points
Interface / Class	Key point
Iterable	Enhanced for loop support
Collection	List, Set, Queue ka parent interface
List	Ordered, duplicates allowed
Set	Unique elements
Queue	Processing elements
Deque	Dono ends se insertion/removal
ArrayList	Dynamic array
LinkedList	List aur Deque implement karta hai
HashSet	Hash-based unique elements
TreeSet	Sorted unique elements
HashMap	Hash-based key-value storage
Comparable / Comparator	Object sorting ke liye
Yaad rakho: Vector ek legacy synchronized list hai aur Stack, Vector ko extend karta hai. Modern code mein stack operations ke liye aksar ArrayDeque prefer kiya jata hai.
